    "text": "Glucose: {bg} mg/dL. Correction scale (insulin lispro): 151–200 mg/dL 2 units; 201–250, 4 units; 251–300, 6 units; 301–350, 8 units; over 350, call the prescriber. How many units does the scale say?",
